  "test_construction": "Questions were written against the extracted text of three papers whose PDFs state a CC BY 4.0 licence (see data/papers/MANIFEST.json). Page numbers are 1-based PDF pages. Each answerable item includes a short quotation that occurs on every cited page after whitespace is collapsed. Urdu questions and Urdu reference answers are translations of the paired English items and use the same gold pages; they were not collected as independent field questions. There was no second annotator and no inter-annotator agreement. Unanswerable questions ask about topics that do not occur in the three papers (BLEU, COVID-19 vaccines, LLaMA, photosynthesis). The disjoint pilot file is used only to set the evidence-gate threshold. Scores are reported on this test file only. This is a small project benchmark, not a community dataset.",
  "pilot_construction": "Disjoint from data/qa/gold.json. These eight questions are used only to choose the per-method evidence-gate threshold. They are not included in the reported test scores. Urdu items are translations of the English items.",
